        "TileImage": "$($repository 2a4bb5cc-794a-453f-8b72-549a965770ae).Image",
        "Description": "The Vantrex Obscura Network has embedded three operatives across the chaos of the Miami race, each serving a different function within the syndicate’s early‑stage operations. Eliminating them will cripple V.O.N.’s foothold in the city and send a clear message.\r\rV.O.N. is a covert network woven into everyday life, hiding operatives behind ordinary roles while quietly shaping events through precision, secrecy, and silent influence.",
